    <!-- Legal Content -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_content"><![CDATA[
        <h3>Privacy Policy 2026</h3>
        <p>Your privacy is important to us at <b>BuySmart AI</b>. This policy outlines how we handle your data in the year 2026 and beyond.</p>
        <h4>1. Data Collection</h4>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you create an account, save products, or set price alerts. This includes your name, email, and preferences.</p>
        <h4>2. AI Data Usage</h4>
        <p>Our AI models analyze your shopping behavior to provide personalized recommendations and predict price drops. This data is processed securely and is never sold to third parties.</p>
        <h4>3. Real-time Monitoring</h4>
        <p>To provide accurate price alerts, we monitor prices across multiple platforms in real-time. Your target prices are stored securely in our cloud database.</p>
        <h4>4. Your Rights</h4>
        <p>You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information at any time through the app settings.</p>
    ]]></string>

    <string name="terms_content"><![CDATA[
        <h3>Terms & Conditions</h3>
        <p>Welcome to BuySmart AI. By using our application, you agree to the following terms:</p>
        <h4>1. Use of Service</h4>
        <p>You agree to use BuySmart AI only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of others.</p>
        <h4>2. Pricing Accuracy</h4>
        <p>While we strive for 100% accuracy, prices across e-commerce platforms change rapidly. BuySmart AI is not responsible for discrepancies between our predicted prices and actual checkout prices.</p>
        <h4>3. Account Security</h4>
        <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account and password.</p>
        <h4>4. AI Recommendations</h4>
        <p>Our AI "Buy/Wait" recommendations are based on historical data patterns and should be used as a helpful guide, not as guaranteed financial advice.</p>
    ]]></string>

    <string name="about_content"><![CDATA[
        <h3>About BuySmart AI</h3>
        <p><b>BuySmart AI</b> is the world\'s most advanced AI-powered shopping assistant, launched in 2024 and revolutionized in 2026.</p>
        <p>Our mission is to help you save money and time by using cutting-edge machine learning to predict price drops, find hidden coupons, and compare millions of products across the web in milliseconds.</p>
        <p>Developed by a team of shopping experts and AI researchers, BuySmart is your ultimate companion for the modern e-commerce era.</p>
    ]]></string>

    <string name="help_content"><![CDATA[
        <h3>Help & Support</h3>
        <p>Need assistance? We\'re here to help you shop smarter!</p>
        <h4>Common Questions:</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><b>How do Price Alerts work?</b> - Click the bell icon on any product. When the price hits your target, we\'ll send a push notification.</li>
            <li><b>How does Auto-Coupon work?</b> - Add items to your cart. Our AI automatically scans and applies the best working code at checkout.</li>
            <li><b>Is my data safe?</b> - Yes, we use 256-bit encryption for all your profile and preference data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For further support, email us at: <b>support@buysmart.ai</b></p>
    ]]></string>
